  <item>
    <title>游戏酒馆——宫本武藏轶事，各种流传版本中的宫本武藏是什么样子的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa572f6492687f6aad8e8a5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa572f6492687f6aad8e8a5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>录制时间：2026年9月9日</span></p><p><span>播客成员：饿鱼、老白</span></p><p><span>提到宫本武藏，大家第一反应往往是吉冈道场的连挑数十人、岩流岛迟到的船桨绝杀，或是《五轮书》里的孤高剑圣。但如果剥去后世戏剧与小说的滤镜，江户民间的稗官野史与各类记录里，真实的武藏究竟是个怎样的人？</span></p><p><span>本期节目，我们把视线投向那些散落民间的杂记与逸话。不聊神坛上的武圣，只扒市井记录里的活人。</span></p><p><span>无论你是剑戟片与武士历史爱好者，还是单纯想听名士“人设崩塌”的八卦听友，这期节目都将带你重新认识那个既硬核又带着几分荒诞的宫本武藏。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRYqiHtgQa84Wmij_iwg3uvZ6dp.jpg"><p><span>岩户山-灵岩洞</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqcb7CaK-zUP0GPrwRUymJYu-4_b.jpg"><p><span>五轮书</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3huBLNb4GjsGHFuHYAUl4Z-Xxf.jpg"><p><span>忠孝传</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPMAKLcl_qRfb_NvKrauGUXNM-x.jpg"><p><span>林崎新夢想流居合伝書</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsbSBTGeL6Qx1MtCJsDEkP5MKe4u.jpg"><p><span>下刀</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiBJAeUPiPXTSoIJHCgbl1zTc_0i.jpg"><p><span>太刀佩戴</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpvP5sdA45ktHluVeFGcnbHOvwm4.webp"><p></p><p><span>鬼金棒拉面</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAVvXXMQXZ4_43OcarBKzrgurVw.jpg"><p><span>小倉碑文——吉冈灭门</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjzlkwSB8IFjqyc75zMrZLAa_LmJ.jpg"><p><span>有马喜兵卫2</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkBQVeU7G3PBwFdy-oZeztdeZdJa.jpg"><p><span>有马喜兵卫</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm44lA6DXDLDdweZ_eBYx9hc3wem.jpg"><p><span>武藏来记</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTIEH17GAHYWng07r4eNldk82tD.jpg"><p><span>岩流岛</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtnbiAwF6DxQLRTFhlDsTTbgBkqt.jpg"><p><span>出云阿国</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llaydzDqf9P_PcKcDXiRYLb9JqRq.png"><p><span>倾奇舞</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlFH0i1_g9hdSoP3YMOQbJJ570j.jpg"><p><span>赤鬼青鬼-金棒</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoueyV1-u2boMtJ0qnq2mOyae_1G.jpg"><p><span>上泉信纲</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FldBnh3Uxc-OlAOQzS81PHKg1Jv8.webp"><p><span>冢原卜传</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk6QmEAHUh_TCkHSvfnYw_sYjTXU.jpg"><p><span>打刀和胁差</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/659510f21519ccb1038bfe4a/lg47Ou6Ghk--rtEOY4rlzlcnkbIy.m4a" length="68710892" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqREmkI0F8ZYofQ0qaHnSKvqDhq7.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
